OL,3,AMan arrested after boy, 16, dies in
OL,4,Acrash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been arrested after a
OL,7,F16-year-old boy was killed in a crash
OL,8,Fin Birmingham.
OL,10,FPolice said the teenager was in a white
OL,11,FSeat Ibiza which was understood to have
OL,12,Fhit railings on Shaftmoor Lane at about
OL,13,F20:30 BST on Saturday.
OL,15,FA second passenger, a boy in his teens,
OL,16,Fwas taken to hospital with a serious
OL,17,Farm injury.
OL,23,APub: 18-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
